OL,3,GNEWSA#30 rise in payments for
OL,4,Acrisis-hit households
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrisis payments for people in Sheffield
OL,7,Fwho are facing severe financial
OL,8,Fdifficulties have been raised by #30.
OL,10,FSingle person households which qualify
OL,11,Ffor help from Sheffield City Council's
OL,12,Fcrisis and resilience fund will now be
OL,13,Fentitled to a one-off payment of #95,
OL,14,Fup from #65 previously.
OL,16,FMeanwhile, two-person households can
OL,17,Fapply for a payment of #110, while
OL,18,Fhomes with three or four people are
OL,19,Fentitled to #120 if they qualify and
OL,20,Fhouseholds with five or more people can
OL,21,Fget #130, the authority confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
