OL,3,GNEWSA#30 rise in payments for
OL,4,Acrisis-hit households
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnnouncing the change, councillor Elle
OL,7,FDodd, chair of the authority's finance
OL,8,Fand performance policy committee, said
OL,9,Flife was "difficult and expensive" for
OL,10,F"too many people" in Sheffield.
